<!doctype html>
<!--
  Rendered by /docker-entrypoint.nginx.sh, once per tab, into the html directory it is configured with:
  index.html (the first tab), tab-2.html ... tab-N.html when the desktop needs more than one page, and
  all.html as the everything-on-one-page view. Which panes are on which page is decided by the
  entrypoint (see PANES_PER_TAB there); this file only knows how a page of panes looks.

  The structure below is generic on purpose: a group is a set of panes that share one half of the
  viewport and split it equally, and the entrypoint decides which groups exist, in which order, and how
  many panes each holds. Nothing here knows the name of an agent.

  Substituted in by the entrypoint (every marker is a whole line except the title, so each gets its own
  line here):
    GRID_CSS   the per-page rules: the one rule that splits the viewport between the two groups, and the
               height of the tab strip, which the expanded-pane rule needs as a number
    PAGE_TITLE inline in the title element below ("slopyphus" for the first tab, "slopyphus - tab 2" for
               the next, "slopyphus - all" for all.html)
    TAB_NAV    the tab strip, or nothing at all when this desktop fits on one page
    GROUPS     the pane markup: a group-columns / group-rows div of cell divs, each holding an iframe

  Everything that is the same for every page - the desktop's own CSS (scrollbars, labels, the focus ring,
  an expanded pane) and the whole script (focus tracking, the Alt+Shift chords, the rule injected into
  each pane's document) - is not here. It is /slopyphus-desktop.css and /slopyphus-desktop.js, plain
  files baked into the image by Dockerfile.nginx and linked by every page, so that N pages rendered from
  this one template cannot drift from each other in the places the desktop is judged on.
-->
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>@@PAGE_TITLE@@</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/slopyphus-desktop.css" />
    <style>
@@GRID_CSS@@
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
@@TAB_NAV@@
    <div id="wrap">
@@GROUPS@@
    </div>
    <script src="/slopyphus-desktop.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
